{'symbol': 'MSI', 'date': '2022-12-09 06:00:00', 'title': 'LITHUANIA MODERNIZES FRONTLINE POLICING WITH BODY-WORN CAMERAS FROM MOTOROLA SOLUTIONS', 'text': 'CHICAGO--( BUSINESS WIRE )--MOTOROLA SOLUTIONS (NYSE: MSI) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT MORE THAN 2,500 VB400 BODY-WORN CAMERAS ARE BEING DEPLOYED TO THE LITHUANIAN NATIONAL POLICE AND BORDER GUARD SERVICE. THE NEW BODY-WORN VIDEO SOLUTIONS WILL BE USED BY FRONTLINE TEAMS TO HELP INCREASE TRANSPARENCY IN POLICING AND BORDER PROTECTION.'}